# A registration may rename a version that is already registered, so the
# effective catalog names one version twice.
MODULE: CatalogConsistentRenameAdmitted
TARGET: CatalogConsistent
CLASS: Invariant
SUMMARY: the merge stops refusing a descriptor whose name differs

--- FIND
    /\ \A x \in a.d, y \in D : x[1] = y[1] => x[2] = y[2]
--- REPLACE
    /\ TRUE
--- END